title: Add try_state hook to pallet-whitelist
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "Adds a `try_state` hook to `pallet-whitelist` asserting its storage\
    \ invariant (every call hash in `WhitelistedCall` has a requested preimage, kept\
    \ in lock-step via `request`/`unrequest`), closing part of #239, which never tracked\
    \ this pallet.\r\n"
crates:
- name: pallet-whitelist
  bump: minor
